cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software when using the N-Series Lean formal verification."
title: "N-Series Lean Verification"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Baker"
    given-names: "Wayne"

version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-11-13

repository-code: "https://github.com/CWBaker360/nseries-lean-verification"
url: "https://github.com/CWBaker360/nseries-lean-verification"

abstract: >-
  Formal verification in Lean 4 and Mathlib of the N-Series
  polygonal approximation to pi. The development establishes
  polygon convergence, Richardson acceleration, explicit
  error bounds, multiscale moment cancellation, Lagrange
  interpolation weights, and geometric chord-trisection results.
  The integrated release comprises 28 mathematical modules,
  with 112 declarations included in the axiom audit.

keywords:
  - "Lean 4"
  - "Mathlib"
  - "formal verification"
  - "N-Series"
  - "polygonal approximation"
  - "Richardson extrapolation"
  - "moment cancellation"
  - "geometric trisection"

